Number":13,"title":{"value":"Mermaime, l'arrogante","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Xenon dispatches Demon Mermaim to assist Xannin in his fight against Devilman. She does not care for Xannin, and puts a spell on him to prevent his interference. Mermaim moves in and attacks the Makimura family while they are on vacation. As Devilman does battle with Mermaim, Xannin discovers Miki.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1972-10-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1GUH93HpLUV19I1Yt6NG9sYaW92.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1GUH93HpLUV19I1Yt6NG9sYaW92.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68586/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"1473482","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Sfida nel Regno dei Ghiacci","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Miki is rushed to the hospital after an altercation with Xannin. Furious, and heartbroken, Devilman swears to defeat the Demon Tribe once and for all. He flies to the Himalayas to settle things with Xenon, only to find the Tribe is gone. Himura appears and finally reveals his true identity.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1972-10-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k5MSvJEoIHsIuXUrdR3PNWXobQq.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k5MSvJEoIHsIuXUrdR3PNWXobQq.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68586/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"1473483","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Ebain, il demone dalle mille braccia","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The centaur-type, horned demon Evine uses mirrors to control people's arms.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1972-10-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/byjG4KkMbGLfu92H5Q7QAE6yq6K.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/byjG4KkMbGLfu92H5Q7QAE6yq6K.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68586/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"1473484","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Jenny, il demone che vive nell'ombra","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"During a meteor shower, all of the children in town start seeing a glowing red star. They soon begin receiving terrible nightmares and are driven to the point of insanity.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1972-10-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2I3EacUGSqa78g15SpAUdCmTebK.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2I3EacUGSqa78g15SpAUdCmTebK.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68586/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"1473485","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Dagon, il demone dei francobolli","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Akira, Miki, Tare, and his friends come across a mysterious storyteller. The storyteller gives children stamps with monster designs on them. At night, the monsters come to life and attack.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1972-11-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8mcPsnJqYHtGx7v6xX3CDLfYXng.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8mcPsnJqYHtGx7v6xX3CDLfYXng.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68586/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"1473486","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Mayako, il demone d'argento","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A beautiful young woman named Mayako begins working at Cafe Chaco. Her alluring beauty has smitten all of the males in town. When young boys start killing themselves over Mayako, Akira wonders if there's more behind her allure.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1972-11-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/euSY3eAeR1qW8wyOuxrtG7swU0A.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/euSY3eAeR1qW8wyOuxrtG7swU0A.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68586/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"1473487","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Adal, lo stratega dei manichini","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Tare comes across a dumping ground with tons of mannequins. Later at night, he sees a mannequin in his room and attacks it with a hammer. It turns out the mannequin was Miki, who was killed by his attack. Distressed, Tare runs away from home.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1972-11-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gCGJXyZgTg7kgz1v5lgatv6QSrX.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gCGJXyZgTg7kgz1v5lgatv6QSrX.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68586/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"1473488","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Addio, demone Dorango","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A new transfer student named Tomita arrives at Nakado Academy and takes a liking to Miki. This angers Akira, who views Tomita as a rival.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1972-11-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/amqg9y6yBtkrS7ZGnGhcVH2FXUz.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/amqg9y6yBtkrS7ZGnGhcVH2FXUz.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68586/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"1473489","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Doro, il demone goloso di umani","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Demon Draw has a bottomless appetite and sets his eyes on Nakado Academy.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"1972-12-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":25,"thumbnail":"https://imag